From 42618fa556a550a58e8bcf5d2e373bc5742885f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zhuqingping <zhuqingping1@contributor>


Date: Sat, 8 Mar 2025 15:59:58 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] [Feature] USERSTORY Support Native Package Framework

Summary:
--------
Native package is designed as a collection of procedures or other elements
which are builtin objects that can be executed through "CALL xxx()";

All the native procedure should implement two interface:
  1) Proc interface
    It is procedure definition, included parameters, columns, result type.

  2) Sql_cmd_proc interface
    It defined procedure execution logic

The Framework supplied two demo native procedures "dummy" and "dummy_3" on debug mode;

mysql> call mysql.dummy();
Query OK, 0 rows affected

mysql> call mysql.dummy_3(1, 'MySQL', 99.99);
+----------+------+-------+
| NAME     | ID   | NUM   |
+----------+------+-------+
| MySQL |    1 | 99.99 |
+----------+------+-------+

   3) support show_native_procedure to show all procedure

On debug mode, show_native_procedure result as follows:
mysql> call dbms_admin.show_native_procedure();
+-------------+-----------------------+------------+-------------------------------+
| SCHEMA_NAME | PROC_NAME             | PROC_TYPE  | PARAMETERS                    |
+-------------+-----------------------+------------+-------------------------------+
| dbms_admin  | show_native_procedure | ADMIN_PROC |                               |
| mysql       | dummy                 | ADMIN_PROC |                               |
| mysql       | dummy_3               | ADMIN_PROC | LONGLONG, VARCHAR, NEWDECIMAL |
+-------------+-----------------------+------------+-------------------------------+
3 rows in set (0.00 sec)

On release mode, show_native_procedure result as follows:
mysql> call dbms_admin.show_native_procedure();
+-------------+-----------------------+------------+------------+
| SCHEMA_NAME | PROC_NAME             | PROC_TYPE  | PARAMETERS |
+-------------+-----------------------+------------+------------+
| dbms_admin  | show_native_procedure | ADMIN_PROC |            |
+-------------+-----------------------+------------+------------+
1 row in set (0.00 sec)

Other fix:
1) Cherry-pick native package bug fix BUGFIX.
2) For hw developers, error numbers(to client) starting at 7500, to avoid subsequent conflicts with community.

(cherry picked from commit 30fbe5f442db1229eb37c2d2812fdc611b4989d7)
Signed-off-by: zhuqingping 00835654 <zhuqingping1@huawei.com>
